			"notes": "<img width=\"854\" height=\"480\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a64e971-1846-432f-9ef8-8b6d397b2cf8\" />\n\n### **This update adds:**\n- Shored sand & gravel, which are not affected by gravity\n- Compressed versions of cobblestone, mossy cobblestone, polished stone, polished stone tiles and polished netherrack\n- Iron & steel plating blocks\n- Small marble & lapis tiles\n- Vent block (purely decorational)\n\n### **Other notable things in this update:**\n- Migrated to BTA! 8.0.1\n- Migrated to Halplibe 6.1.4\n- MAJOR code optimisation and restructuring\n- Fixed some crafting recipes having wrong outputs\n- Changed mixin registry key\n- Assigned proper materials and sounds to all blocks\n- Custom texture mapping for checkered tiles block and checkered tiles stairs\n- New and improved automatic crafting recipe registry"
		},
